OL,3,GNEWSAThe deadly new drugs reshaping
OL,4,AScotland's fight against addiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfforts to bring down Scotland's
OL,7,Fsky-high rate of drug deaths are being
OL,8,Ffrustrated by the arrival of hundreds
OL,9,Fof powerful new synthetic substances
OL,10,Fthat experts warn are making the deadly
OL,11,Fdrugs crisis even more dangerous.
OL,13,FIn the past three years, there has been
OL,14,Fan explosion in the supply of new
OL,15,Fsynthetic cannabinoids and opioids,
OL,16,Ftransforming the illicit drugs trade
OL,17,Fand increasing the risk of fatal
OL,18,Foverdoses.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
