OL,3,GNEWSAThe deadly new drugs reshaping
OL,4,AScotland's fight against addiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnual figures to be released on
OL,7,FWednesday are expected to show a rise
OL,8,Fin the number of drug-related deaths in
OL,9,FScotland, which already has an
OL,10,Funenviable record as the drugs death
OL,11,Fcapital of Europe.
OL,13,F"The illicit drug supply in Scotland is
OL,14,Fgetting more and more dangerous," said
OL,15,FDr Lorna Nisbet of Dundee University's
OL,16,FLeverhulme Research Centre for Forensic
OL,17,FScience.
